          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770903222863_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert data analyst with a strong understanding of organizational structures such as departments, business units, legal employers, and equivalent entities.\n\nHere's the user's query:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nHere's the query plan:\n{{$context.$nodes.QUERY_PLANNER.$output}}\n\nHere are the semantic search results:\n{{$context.$nodes.RESOLVE_ORG_STRUCTURES.$output.results}}\n\nYour task is to FILTER the semantic search results and PRODUCE a NORMALIZED OUTPUT.\n\nEvaluation rules:\n1. Treat each element in the results array independently.\n2. A result is a GOOD MATCH only if ALL of the following are true:\n - The value of \"supportingChunks\" closely matches a real organizational structure name\n (for example: department, business unit, legal employer, or equivalent).\n - The \"supportingChunks\" text is semantically consistent with the organization type\n indicated in metadata.orgType.\n - The \"supportingChunks\" text closely matches the intent and entity described in:\n - the user's query, AND\n - the query plan, specifically orgStructureQueryPayload.query.\n3. If a result refers to a different country, business, legal entity, or organization\n than the one implied by the query plan, it is a POOR MATCH and must be removed.\n4. Do NOT infer or guess missing information. Only use the data present in each result,\n the user query, and the query plan.\n\nOutput rules:\n- Return a JSON array only.\n- Each element in the array must be an object with exactly these keys:\n - orgId: derived from metadata.orgId\n - orgType: derived from metadata.orgType\n- Include one object per GOOD MATCH.\n- Do NOT include any other fields.\n- Do NOT add explanations or commentary.\n- If no results qualify as good matches, return an empty array []."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"GoodMatchOrgArray\",\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"description\": \"Array of good match org results. Empty array if no good matches.\",\n  \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false,\n    \"required\": [\"orgId\", \"orgType\"],\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"orgId\": {\n        \"type\": [\"string\", \"number\"],\n        \"description\": \"Derived from metadata.orgId\"\n      },\n      \"orgType\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"enum\": [\"LE\", \"DEP\", \"BU\"],\n        \"description\": \"Derived from metadata.orgType. Allowed values: LE (Legal Entity), DEP (Department), BU (Business Unit).\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
